# neck/man/kerchief: the man's neckerchief in accent: the band about his neck, its point down his chest, the knot at the nape
# with two tails that hang at rest and fly back in the side walks and the run (neck keys flow / flow2, A3's scarf timing)
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
